<title>POLAND: Celuloza exempted from PLN 5.6 mln fines.</title>
<headline>Celuloza exempted from PLN 5.6 mln fines.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's environment protection authorities have exempted paper firm Celuloza Swiecie SA from fines totalling 5.6 million zlotys which it was supposed to to pay, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company said the authorities exempted it from the fines for disposing of waste products in 1994-1996 because its investment in environment protection during that period was much higher than the fines. It did not give any further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
